WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.549
SEE AND HEAR. Point to eyes and ears on a friendly diagram.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.799
SMELL AND SPEAK. Highlight nose and mouth.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.948
HOLD. Show hands grasping a light pencil.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.500
MOVE. Show legs walking safely.
